The neural network components (CSP-based backbone, PAN neck, detection /
segmentation / pose / 6DoF heads, and convolutional building blocks) are an
independent implementation written from architectural descriptions using
PyTorch only. The project does not depend on, bundle, or load weights from the
Ultralytics library or any AGPL-licensed software.

External pretrained weights, when used (e.g. DINOv3 as a distillation teacher),
are obtained separately by the user and remain subject to their own licenses.
